Regression test: a status indicator without a range shows only its text, no empty progress bar.

A Writer frame's status indicator is started with no range (XStatusIndicator::start(text, 0)); the
status bar in progress mode is painted to a virtual device and must show no pixel besides its
background below the top separator line. An indicator with a range must still draw its bar.

License: the new test file is HST-owned (LicenseRef-HST-Proprietary); the makefile keeps MPL-2.0.
Test: CppunitTest_framework_dispatch (HstStatusBarTextOnlyTest).
